NOTE ON USE WITH REAL PATIENT DATA

This software was built and tested against synthetic data only. It is not
validated for clinical use. Nothing in this licence should be read as a
representation that it is fit to process real patient records, real insurance
claims, or to submit to NHCX. See docs/PRODUCTION_READINESS.md for the legal,
clinical and institutional gates that a real deployment must clear first —
most of which cannot be closed by writing code.
